{"4146760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apocalypter", "steam_appid": 4146760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5018330], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to <strong>survive</strong> in this savage <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> world with your <strong>customized cars</strong>. You must <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>help</strong> or <strong>trade</strong>  to stay alive. Eliminate all the <strong>warlords</strong> and attach their <strong>trophies</strong> to your car. Find <strong>different cars</strong> and customize them with Apocalypter's <strong>unique customization</strong> system. <strong>Scavenge</strong>, <strong>loot</strong>  and build your perfect car to survive the <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, <strong>open world</strong> of Apocalypter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Car customization</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any kind of car part can be installed to any car, <strong>no limitations</strong>. Install better <strong>suspension, engine, radiator</strong>. Cosmetic parts such as steering wheel, gear lever, seats etc. <strong>Move and rotate</strong> engine, exhaust or radiator to you liking with the part adjuster tool. Install <strong>roof rack, crates and boxes</strong> for <strong>more storage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>different melee</strong> and <strong>ranged weapons, guns</strong> with different stats and calibers. <strong>Enemies</strong> also use these weapons and randomly <strong>drop </strong>their <strong>ammo, weapons </strong>or<strong> healing items</strong>. Equip <strong>body armor</strong>, <strong>bandage</strong> or <strong>first aid kit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Survival</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat the <strong>bugs, dogfood</strong> and <strong>mystery meats</strong>. Make you car into a <strong>moving base</strong>, by using <strong>portable maggot farms, dew collectors, weed</strong> and <strong>tobacco plants.</strong> <strong>Butcher</strong> animals, mutants and <strong>cook</strong> their meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Exploration</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>infinite, procedurally generated</strong> world. Use your <strong>compass</strong> and <strong>landmarks</strong> to <strong>navigate</strong>. Follow <strong>roads</strong> for easier navigation, but don't get attached to them, sometimes they lead to nowhere. Find <strong>abandoned buildings</strong>, <strong>wrecks</strong>, <strong>caves</strong>, <strong>faction camps</strong> and <strong>bases</strong>. <strong>Trade</strong> or <strong>fight</strong> with <strong>different factions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Trade</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell items</strong> that you looted and don't need. <strong>Buy</strong> various items from traders. <strong>Merchants</strong> have <strong>randomized</strong> items that they sell and buy. <strong>Currency</strong> in Apocalypter is rusted <strong>nuts</strong>, collect them and use them to buy items you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Character upgrade</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character with <strong>body armor</strong>, <strong>backpack</strong>, <strong>flashlight</strong> and <strong>binocular</strong> for better survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of car parts that can be installed to any car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different enemy types, mutants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, loot, survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butchering, cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades (body armor, backpack, flashlight etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading, buy/sell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated random world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Controller Support (driving only) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo note:</strong> The Demo is an outdated version of the game with much less content, only one car, one boss, and only one save slot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to <strong>survive</strong> in this savage <strong>post-apocalyptic</strong> world with your <strong>customized cars</strong>. You must <strong>fight</strong>, <strong>help</strong> or <strong>trade</strong>  to stay alive. Eliminate all the <strong>warlords</strong> and attach their <strong>trophies</strong> to your car. Find <strong>different cars</strong> and customize them with Apocalypter's <strong>unique customization</strong> system. <strong>Scavenge</strong>, <strong>loot</strong>  and build your perfect car to survive the <strong>procedurally generated</strong>, <strong>open world</strong> of Apocalypter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Car customization</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any kind of car part can be installed to any car, <strong>no limitations</strong>. Install better <strong>suspension, engine, radiator</strong>. Cosmetic parts such as steering wheel, gear lever, seats etc. <strong>Move and rotate</strong> engine, exhaust or radiator to you liking with the part adjuster tool. Install <strong>roof rack, crates and boxes</strong> for <strong>more storage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/202fe3e1e5d1267be164ce364a54f0f3.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many <strong>different melee</strong> and <strong>ranged weapons, guns</strong> with different stats and calibers. <strong>Enemies</strong> also use these weapons and randomly <strong>drop </strong>their <strong>ammo, weapons </strong>or<strong> healing items</strong>. Equip <strong>body armor</strong>, <strong>bandage</strong> or <strong>first aid kit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/2944443bad88d5c2cd46aa04125621d6.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Survival</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat the <strong>bugs, dogfood</strong> and <strong>mystery meats</strong>. Make you car into a <strong>moving base</strong>, by using <strong>portable maggot farms, dew collectors, weed</strong> and <strong>tobacco plants.</strong> <strong>Butcher</strong> animals, mutants and <strong>cook</strong> their meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/5a7181caee94b9d9d53ab51decde637e.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Exploration</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>infinite, procedurally generated</strong> world. Use your <strong>compass</strong> and <strong>landmarks</strong> to <strong>navigate</strong>. Follow <strong>roads</strong> for easier navigation, but don't get attached to them, sometimes they lead to nowhere. Find <strong>abandoned buildings</strong>, <strong>wrecks</strong>, <strong>caves</strong>, <strong>faction camps</strong> and <strong>bases</strong>. <strong>Trade</strong> or <strong>fight</strong> with <strong>different factions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.poster.avif?t=1788280808\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.webm?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/extras/35fb858d3a5f9a92ccaf5ef6c2b2ee6f.mp4?t=1788280808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Trade</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell items</strong> that you looted and don't need. <strong>Buy</strong> various items from traders. <strong>Merchants</strong> have <strong>randomized</strong> items that they sell and buy. <strong>Currency</strong> in Apocalypter is rusted <strong>nuts</strong>, collect them and use them to buy items you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Character upgrade</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character with <strong>body armor</strong>, <strong>backpack</strong>, <strong>flashlight</strong> and <strong>binocular</strong> for better survivability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-apocalyptic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot's of car parts that can be installed to any car</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different melee and ranged weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different enemy types, mutants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, loot, survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Butchering, cooking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades (body armor, backpack, flashlight etc)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading, buy/sell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated random world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/Night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial Controller Support (driving only) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steering wheel support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo note:</strong> The Demo is an outdated version of the game with much less content, only one car, one boss, and only one save slot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Apocalypter is a post-apocalyptic, driving, survival, fps, open-world game. Fight, help, trade with different factions. Find different cars and customize them. Scavenge, loot and survive the procedurally generated, open world of Apocalypter.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/014c9caa40fc0043deef5e238ee1f6e94afbb7bd/header.jpg?t=1788280808", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/41ce9cfed168a5f11592f3c1e7f49478640d9e8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788280808", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146760/41ce9cfed168a5f11592f3c1e7f49478640d9e8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788280808", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64bit version of Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> +3 GHZ quad co